@startuml LINE OAuth2 Backend Callback Sequence
!theme aws-orange
title LINE OAuth 2.0 Authentication with Backend Callback\n(CORS-Free Production Architecture)

actor User as U
participant "Frontend\n(line.depick.wtf)" as FE
participant "Backend\n(api.depick.wtf)" as BE
participant "LINE Platform\n(access.line.me)" as LINE
database "Backend Storage\n(nonce, sessions)" as DB

== Initialization ==
U -> FE: Click "Connect with LINE"
activate FE

FE -> BE: GET /auth/line/nonce
activate BE
BE -> DB: Generate & store nonce
BE --> FE: { nonce, nonceId }
deactivate BE

== OAuth Authorization Request ==
FE -> FE: Build OAuth URL\n(backend callback URL)
note right of FE
  OAuth URL:
  https://access.line.me/oauth2/v2.1/authorize?
  response_type=code&
  client_id=2007331425&
  redirect_uri=https://api.depick.wtf/auth/line/callback&
  scope=profile%20openid&
  state=nonceId&
  bot_prompt=aggressive&
  nonce=nonce
end note

FE -> U: Redirect to LINE OAuth
deactivate FE

U -> LINE: Access OAuth URL
activate LINE

== LINE Authentication & Consent ==
LINE -> U: Show login screen
U -> LINE: Enter credentials

LINE -> U: Show consent screen\n+ Official Account add prompt
note right of LINE
  bot_prompt=aggressive forces
  Official Account friend addition
end note

U -> LINE: Consent + Add Official Account
LINE -> LINE: Process authentication\n& authorization

== Backend Callback (CORS-Free) ==
LINE -> BE: Redirect with auth code\nGET /auth/line/callback?code=AUTH_CODE&state=nonceId
deactivate LINE
activate BE

BE -> DB: Verify state (nonceId)
BE -> DB: Retrieve stored nonce

== Token Exchange ==
BE -> LINE: POST /oauth2/v2.1/token\n(exchange code for tokens)
activate LINE
LINE --> BE: { access_token, id_token }
deactivate LINE

== Token Verification ==
BE -> LINE: POST /oauth2/v2.1/verify\n(verify ID token + nonce)
activate LINE
LINE --> BE: Verified user profile
deactivate LINE

== User Profile Retrieval ==
BE -> LINE: GET /v2/profile\n(Bearer access_token)
activate LINE
LINE --> BE: Complete user profile
deactivate LINE

== Session Creation ==
BE -> BE: Create JWT token\nwith user data
BE -> DB: Store user session
BE -> DB: Delete used nonce

== Frontend Redirect ==
BE -> FE: HTTP 302 Redirect\nhttps://line.depick.wtf?auth_token=JWT&auth_success=true
deactivate BE
activate FE

== Frontend Token Processing ==
FE -> FE: Extract auth_token from URL
FE -> FE: Decode JWT (client-side)
FE -> FE: Clean URL (remove token)

FE -> U: Authentication successful\n(display user info)
deactivate FE

== Optional: Subsequent API Calls ==
FE -> BE: API calls with JWT token\nAuthorization: Bearer JWT
activate BE
BE -> BE: Validate JWT signature
BE --> FE: Protected resources
deactivate BE

@enduml